
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CUSTUPD.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.

    SELECT CUST-FILE
    ASSIGN TO CUSTFILE
    ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
    RECORD KEY IS CUST-ID
    FILE STATUS IS WS-STATUS.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.

FD CUST-FILE.
01 CUST-REC.
   05 CUST-ID   PIC X(6).
   05 CUST-NAME PIC X(20).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 WS-STATUS PIC XX.
01 WS-NEW-REC.
   05 WS-CUST-ID   PIC X(6).
   05 WS-CUST-NAME PIC X(20).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    OPEN I-O CUST-FILE

    MOVE 'C00100' TO CUST-ID

    READ CUST-FILE
       KEY IS CUST-ID
       INVALID KEY
          DISPLAY 'CUSTOMER NOT FOUND'
    END-READ

    IF WS-STATUS = '00'

       MOVE CUST-REC TO WS-NEW-REC

       DELETE CUST-FILE
          RECORD
       END-DELETE

       IF WS-STATUS = '00'

          MOVE 'C00999' TO WS-CUST-ID

          MOVE WS-NEW-REC TO CUST-REC

          WRITE CUST-REC
             INVALID KEY
                DISPLAY 'WRITE FAILED'
          END-WRITE

          IF WS-STATUS = '00'
             DISPLAY 'CUSTOMER KEY UPDATED'
          END-IF

       END-IF

    END-IF

    CLOSE CUST-FILE

    STOP RUN.
